units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p f
atom_style atomic
lattice bcc 3.3
region projectile block 0 20 0 20 0 20
region target block 0 20 0 20 20.15 100.15
region whole union 2 projectile target
create_box 1 whole
create_atoms 1 region projectile
create_atoms 1 region target
pair_style eam
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify every 1
velocity all create 300 12345
fix 1 all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
run 100000
unfix 1
velocity all set 0 0 20 units box region projectile
fix 2 all nve
run 100000
